SUMMARY:Wednesday Morning's Breakfast Rides  Casual Pace Variable Distance
  RSVP
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nEvery Wednesday morning..
 .Ride and eat Yummy breakfast together.\n\nPlease do not go on this ride u
 nless you will ride at a casual pace and stay with the group . We will mee
 t to ride to breakfast at a casual pace. After eating some may split up wi
 th some returning to the start and others going longer and faster.\nHelmet
 s are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. Please bri
 ng water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inf
 lator).\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage
  LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP also al
 lows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you ar
 e not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only club mem
 bers who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club me
 mber. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=6
 0&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=6
 0&club_id=257148)\nRichard Conner\, leader717-572-8480
