SUMMARY:ACCR FUN RIDE - LC Muggles Meander (21.9F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: John Cardos\
 nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mph\nRoute: [M
 uggles Meander](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27009622)\n\n**Be Safe\, Ha
 ve Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader w
 ill ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group r
 ide with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her 
 best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitti
 ng into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not jo
 in this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are
  mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare t
 ube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a p
 en and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below
  to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. J
 oin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the cl
 ub's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an
